      "item": "chargrilled Mediterranean veg (peppers and aubergines",
      "quantity": 250,
      "unit": "g",
      "preparation": "if possible) from a jar, pot or deli counter, drained if in oil (you can use this oil in place of the olive oil) and roughly chopped"
